{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "本月账单(2026-09-24):大数 = 本月至今(按 API 标价);变化 = 比上月同样多的天数;条 = 已到上月全月的多少(满条 = 已经超过上月)。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "本月账单",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "lang": "zh",
        "sub": " 月至今 · 按 API 标价",
        "vsSame": "比上月同期 ",
        "ofPrev": "上月全月 ",
        "reach": " · 已到 ",
        "noPrev": "上月没有记录",
        "dayA": "本月已过 ",
        "dayB": "%"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Month",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "lang": "en",
        "sub": "Month to date · API prices",
        "vsSame": "Vs last month ",
        "ofPrev": "Last month ",
        "reach": " · ",
        "noPrev": "No record last month",
        "dayA": "",
        "dayB": "% of month gone"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "本月账单(2026-09-24):大数 = 本月至今(按 API 标价);变化 = 比上月同样多的天数;条 = 已到上月全月的多少(满条 = 已经超过上月)。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.cur}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${w.month.cur}",
            "fontSize": "26pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.cur}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+7.8pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "26pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+30pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${@i18n.lang},zh),${w.month.m},)]${@i18n.sub}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.c}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+45pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.vsSame}${w.month.c}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${w.month.u},1),#C15F3C|#E8916B,#6B7280|#8E939B)]",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-40pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "6pt",
        "bgColor": "#EEE4E0|#2A2522",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "3pt",
          "leftB": "3pt",
          "rightT": "3pt",
          "rightB": "3pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.fill}),k),0,1),1),if::(gt::(${w.month.fill},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-40pt",
            "w": "({parent.w}-24pt)*${w.month.fill}",
            "h": "6pt",
            "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "3pt",
              "leftB": "3pt",
              "rightT": "3pt",
              "rightB": "3pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.dayFill}),k),0,1),1),if::(gt::(${w.month.dayFill},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt+({parent.w}-24pt)*${w.month.dayFill}",
            "y": "{parent.h}-44pt",
            "w": "1.5pt",
            "h": "14pt",
            "bgColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-57pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.dayA}$[round::(calc::(${w.month.dayFill}*100))]${@i18n.dayB}",
            "fontSize": "8.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "alignmentH": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.ofPrev}),k),0,1),1),if::(ge::(${w.month.ofPrev},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.ofPrev}${w.month.prev}${@i18n.reach}${w.month.ofPrev}%",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.cur}),k),0,1),1),if::(lt::(${w.month.ofPrev},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.noPrev}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.month.cur}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.ofPrev}--",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ],
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "dayA"
    ]
  }
}